    <figure class="smg-review-story"><LicensedImage src={lymanPhoto} alt="Happy client Lyman playing a 1948 Gibson L-50 acoustic guitar after selling it to Joe" width={520} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Happy client Lyman playing a 1948 Gibson L-50 acoustic guitar after selling it to Joe</figcaption></figure>
